\fs22  on a panel about chest high on the rear wall. When Hayley and Sarah pounced again, she was already trying to prise the panel away. They all fell to the floor, Kathy evading the others, exploiting their indecision about what they\'92d do if they succeeded in subduing her. And so a protracted parody of some kind of clumsy martial arts ballet played out for nearly a minute, until they all lay exhausted on the floor, their clumsy wrestling decaying into an awkward three-way cuddle. Kathy\'92s head lay on Sarah\'92s thigh; Sarah realised, to her discomfort, Kathy showed no signs of moving, even after she re-caught her breath. Hayley got to her feet first and offered Kathy a hand up.
